Output public/pages/extensions/toasts/scene.mp4
Source tapes/common/settings.tape
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type "node scenes/run.mjs pages/extensions/toasts"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Sleep 1s
# cue: command
Sleep 2s
Type "/changes"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 550ms
# cue: toast
Sleep 3s
Type "Where is the greeting defined?"
Sleep 1600ms
# cue: expired
Sleep 8s
